#
#   readable_stream_tee - what teeing a byte stream with a default reader keeps:
#   ReadableByteStreamTeeParams and the default read request that feeds both branches
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Streams/ReadableStreamTee.cpp (lines 159-320), as part of the
#       ReadableStream stand-in of DESIGN.md §3.6 (region p2s). Teeing a default stream (lines
#       20-157) and the BYOB branch (lines 322-488) are phase 4.
